(1 + b * pp * inv)) % mod\n\t\tfor i in range(idx + 1, N):\n\t\t\tif d[i]:\n\t\t\t\tans = (ans + d[i] * pow(B, N - i - 1, mod) * p_B * inv_B) % mod\n\telse:\n\t\t(T, D) = (0, 0)\n\t\tfor i in range(N):\n\t\t\tdelta_i = min(d[i], b)\n\t\t\tif d[i]:\n\t\t\t\tans = (ans + d[i] * pow(B, N - 1 - i, mod) * p_B * inv_B) % mod\n\t\t\tif delta_i:\n\t\t\t\tT = (T + delta_i * pow(a, N - i - 1, mod) * p_a * inv_a) % mod\n\t\t\t\tD = (D + delta_i * rep) % mod\n\t\tans = (ans - D - b * inv * (T - D)) % mod\n\treturn ans\n(x, rep) = sys.stdin.readline().strip().split()\nx = list(map(int, x))\nprint(solve(x, int(rep)))"
