            "name": "critical_prefix_suffix_decomposition",
            "description": "For counting irresponsible numbers up to a given decimal string, the first (most significant) position where the digit is at least the threshold divides the string into a prefix and a suffix. Digits in the suffix after this critical position contribute independently: any suffix value yields an irresponsible number once the prefix has exceeded the threshold, modulo a fixed adjustment for boundary values captured by the function F.",
