          "name": "carry_trigger_digit_condition",
          "description": "A number is irresponsible if and only if there exists a digit position i where the sum of the digit d_i and the corresponding digit of x+1 exceeds or equals the base B. This condition can be expressed locally using d_i and the incoming carry from lower positions, leading to a stable threshold-based test.",
